<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34453" root="فلج" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلْجٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلَجَ</span> [q. v.]. (S, O, K, &amp;c.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [probably as such] <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَمْرٌ</span> [app. as
meaning An <i>overcoming in a game of hazard</i>];
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلْجٌ</span></b> . (L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَالِجٌ</span>, in two
places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  Also, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِلْجٌ</span></b> , (S, O, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلُجٌّ</span></b> ,
[q. v.,] (Seer, L,) [or perhaps this is a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلْجٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِلْجٌ</span>,] The <i>half</i> of a thing:
(S, O, K:) pl. of the first and second <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلُوجٌ</span>. (S,
O.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُمَا فَلْجَانِ</span> <i>They two are two
halves.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And one says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى رِجْلِهِ فُلُوجٌ</span>,
[pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلْجٌ</span>,] <i>In his foot are fissures,</i> or <i>cracks;</i>
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلُوحٌ</span>. (S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فلح</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلَجٌ</span>.

